"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_13","text":"Look on top of the table.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_09_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_14","text":"There's a checkmark on the lighthouse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["viper","jackal","crow","anis","rapi","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_09_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_15","text":"What do you think that means?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_09_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_16","text":"It could be a resource of some kind. Or it could be signifying Nikkes that need to be rescued.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_09_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_17","text":"Worst case scenario, it could be a trap.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_09_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_18","text":"Even if that's the case, it would be set up by the Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_09_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_09_e_19","text":"There's no way a Rapture squeezed into this tight space, checked off the lighthouse on the map, and left.","jump":null,"exit":false,"ent